                        In GeoGebra Classic, enter the data values for Researcher 1 into column A of the spreadsheet, and enter the data values for Researcher 2 into column B of the spreadsheet. Then use the <q>Multiple Variable Analysis</q> function. Then use the <q>Show Statistics</q> function to display the sample standard deviation for each set of data values.
